Package: tind-mozilla-config
Version: 0.1.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: web
Priority: optional
Recommends: firefox-esr, thunderbird
Installed-Size: 64
Description: Restricted defaults for Firefox ESR and Thunderbird
 System-wide Mozilla enterprise policies: telemetry and studies off, no
 sponsored or promotional content, generative AI features blocked by default
 (but not locked), tracking protection on, DuckDuckGo as the default search
 engine with Startpage as an alternative, and the Bitwarden extension added to
 Firefox (installed from addons.mozilla.org on first start). Nothing is locked, so users can turn
 features back on.
